Description: PHP client for perfcached, over libperfd
 A PHP 8.3 extension on perfcached's native door: the Noise handshake,
 encryption by default, a list of seeds, and failover and spreading across
 the fleet's members with no proxy beside it.  One handle a worker, kept
 across requests under PHP-FPM.
 .
 For Symfony's cache contracts, the composer package perfcached/symfony-cache
 builds on it.
